# Agent tooling (voice-agent)

## Efficiency — Chisle (not Ponytail)

Use **Chisle** for prose + code efficiency (`.cursor/rules/chisle.mdc`).  
**Ponytail is retired** in this repo — do not follow `.ponytail-ref/` rules or write `ponytail:` comments; use `chisle:` if you must mark a deliberate ceiling.

## UI verification — Reticle

User-facing UI work on **dialtact-app** (Vite) is verified with **Reticle** (`reticle_*` MCP tools).  
Instrumented app: `dialtact-app/` · skill: `.agents/skills/install-and-verify` · details: `AGENTS.md` (reticle block) + `RETICLE.md`.  
No verdict from `reticle_act_and_wait` / `reticle_assert` → do not claim the UI change is done. Skip Reticle for docs/backend-only with one-line reason.

## Code navigation — Graft
 
Prefer `graft ask` / MCP graft tools before broad greps (see `AGENTS.md` graft block).

